{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-40","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":40,"points":null,"unitId":"renal","unitLabel":"배설·체액 조절","topic":"사구체·신장","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["renal"],"stem":"신장의신단위(nephron)에서혈액은사구체를지나면서보우만\n주머니로여과된다. 그림은혈액에있는용질이사구체에서투과될\n때용질의크기와전하가투과에미치는영향을보여준다. 용질의\n분자크기는표에나타나있다.\n분자량\n분자반경\n용질\n(달톤)\n(nm)\n＋\nNa\n23\n0.10\n요소\n60\n0.16\n글리신\n75\n0.22\n락토글로빈\n36,000\n2.16\n혈청알부민\n69,000\n3.55\n위현상과관련된설명이나추론으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 혈장에서농도가높은용질일수록사구체에서많이투과\n된다.\nㄴ. 혈청알부민이음전하를띠고있다면사구체에서거의투과\n되지않는다.\nㄷ. 락토글로빈과동일한크기를갖는혈장단백질은사구체\n에서투과된다.\n＋, 물, 요소, 글리신은사구체에서자유롭게투과되나,\nㄹ. Na\n포도당은자유롭게투과되지못한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t039"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t040"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t041"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t042"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t043"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":580,"height":334,"region":0,"bbox":[53.555,84.66,232.0,133.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-40/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":479,"height":291,"region":0,"bbox":[93.555,232.66,191.6,116.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-40/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03